{format_version:1, definitions:[
  {type:'item', id:'retractable_utility_knife', name:'retractable utility knife', mass_g:180, volume_ml:150,
   description:'Dried packing adhesive clings to the blade slide. Someone opened deliveries with this every morning; you keep it for the cloth and canvas that still need cutting.',
   flags:['tool','sharp_edge','electrically_conductive','ferromagnetic','rigid','opaque','thermally_conductive'],
   art:'/art/items/retractable_utility_knife/art.txt', tool_traits:[{id:'house_cutting',tier:1}],
   melee:{damage:[{type:'slashing',amount:500}],attack_cost:100,handling_skill:'knives',grips:[{kind:'one_handed'}],block_capacity:100,allowed_responses:['parry']}},
  {type:'item', id:'tin_snips', name:'tin snips', mass_g:400, volume_ml:350,
   description:'The painted handles have worn smooth where a thumb rested. Their jaws still close cleanly, a small certainty among the abandoned tools.',
   flags:['tool','sharp_edge','electrically_conductive','ferromagnetic','rigid','opaque','thermally_conductive'],
   art:'/art/items/tin_snips/art.txt', tool_traits:[{id:'house_cutting',tier:1}]},
  {type:'item', id:'wood_chisel', name:'wood chisel', mass_g:220, volume_ml:180,
   description:'A darkened wooden handle carries the shallow dents of years at a bench. Its edge offers a patient way to turn rough timber into something worth holding.',
   flags:['tool','sharp_edge','electrically_conductive','ferromagnetic','combustible','water_absorbent','porous','rigid','opaque','thermally_conductive'],
   art:'/art/items/wood_chisel/art.txt'},
  {type:'item', id:'hand_drill', name:'hand drill', mass_g:900, volume_ml:1200,
   description:'The crank turns a little stiffly before the gears settle into their familiar rhythm. There is comfort in a tool whose next turn asks nothing of the power grid.',
   flags:['tool','pointed','electrically_conductive','ferromagnetic','combustible','water_absorbent','porous','rigid','opaque','thermally_conductive'],
   art:'/art/items/hand_drill/art.txt'},
  {type:'item', id:'multimeter', name:'multimeter', mass_g:350, volume_ml:500,
    grid_meter:true,
   description:'A service sticker curls away from the case, its next inspection date still legible. The probes are wound around it as carefully as if the technician meant to return.',
   flags:['tool','electronics','combustible','rigid','opaque','electrically_insulating'],
   art:'/art/items/multimeter/art.txt'},
  {type:'item', id:'socket_wrench_set', name:'socket wrench set', mass_g:2500, volume_ml:3000,
   description:'Each socket has its own hollow in the scuffed carrying case. For once, the smallest pieces are still where someone left them.',
   flags:['tool','electrically_conductive','ferromagnetic','combustible','rigid','opaque','thermally_conductive'],
   art:'/art/items/socket_wrench_set/art.txt'},
  {type:'item', id:'cotton_socks', name:'cotton socks', mass_g:80, volume_ml:200,
   description:'A matched pair with tired ribbing and pale heels. Clean socks belong to the old morning routine, but the small pleasure of pulling them on has survived.',
   flags:['clothing','combustible','water_absorbent','flexible','porous','opaque','electrically_insulating'],
   art:'/art/items/cotton_socks/art.txt',
   armor:{layer:'under',regions:[{region:'left_foot',encumbrance:1},{region:'right_foot',encumbrance:1}],protection:{blunt:20,slashing:30}}},
  {type:'item', id:'hooded_sweatshirt', name:'hooded sweatshirt', mass_g:650, volume_ml:2000,
   description:'The cuffs have softened and the drawcord ends no longer match. It smells faintly of laundry soap, the sort of familiar thing that can make a borrowed room feel inhabited.',
   flags:['clothing','combustible','water_absorbent','flexible','porous','opaque','electrically_insulating'],
   art:'/art/items/hooded_sweatshirt/art.txt',
   armor:{layer:'normal',regions:[{region:'torso',encumbrance:3},{region:'left_arm',encumbrance:3},{region:'right_arm',encumbrance:3},{region:'head',coverage:6000,encumbrance:1},{region:'ears',coverage:6000,encumbrance:1}],protection:{blunt:90,slashing:130,piercing:30}}},
  {type:'item', id:'sneakers', name:'sneakers', mass_g:700, volume_ml:1800,
   description:'Dust has settled into the mesh, but the laces are sound. You find yourself studying the worn soles and wondering how far their owner had planned to walk.',
   flags:['clothing','combustible','water_absorbent','flexible','porous','opaque','electrically_insulating'],
   art:'/art/items/sneakers/art.txt',
   armor:{layer:'outer',regions:[{region:'left_foot',encumbrance:2},{region:'right_foot',encumbrance:2}],protection:{blunt:100,slashing:120,piercing:50}}},
  {type:'item', id:'winter_coat', name:'winter coat', mass_g:1500, volume_ml:4500,
    description:'A heavy cotton-shell coat with quilted lining and a paper bus transfer deep in one pocket. It carries the shape of ordinary waiting: a stop, a late service, a journey home.',
   flags:['clothing','combustible','water_absorbent','flexible','porous','opaque','electrically_insulating'],
   art:'/art/items/winter_coat/art.txt',
   armor:{layer:'outer',regions:[{region:'torso',encumbrance:7},{region:'left_arm',encumbrance:6},{region:'right_arm',encumbrance:6},{region:'head',coverage:6500,encumbrance:3},{region:'ears',coverage:6500,encumbrance:3}],protection:{blunt:150,slashing:200,piercing:50}}},
  {type:'item', id:'work_coveralls', name:'work coveralls', mass_g:1000, volume_ml:3200,
   description:'Old grease has left shadows that no amount of washing removed. The stitched name above the chest pocket is almost gone; the careful repairs at the knees remain.',
   flags:['clothing','combustible','water_absorbent','flexible','porous','opaque','electrically_insulating'],
   art:'/art/items/work_coveralls/art.txt',
   armor:{layer:'normal',regions:[{region:'torso',encumbrance:4},{region:'left_arm',encumbrance:3},{region:'right_arm',encumbrance:3},{region:'left_leg',encumbrance:4},{region:'right_leg',encumbrance:4}],protection:{blunt:120,slashing:180,piercing:60}}},
  {type:'item', id:'hard_hat', name:'hard hat', mass_g:400, volume_ml:1500,
   description:'A faded plastic shell hangs above a web of sweat-darkened suspension straps. Pencil marks under the brim count days on a job that was never finished.',
   flags:['clothing','armor','combustible','rigid','opaque','electrically_insulating'],
   art:'/art/items/hard_hat/art.txt',
   armor:{layer:'outer',regions:[{region:'head',coverage:8500,encumbrance:3}],rigid_regions:['head'],protection:{blunt:600,slashing:300,piercing:150}}},
  {type:'item', id:'welding_gloves', name:'welding gloves', mass_g:350, volume_ml:800,
   description:'Broad leather cuffs remember the bend of their last wearer\'s wrists. The fingers are clumsy, but the thick hide is a reassuring thing to put between your hands and trouble.',
   flags:['clothing','armor','combustible','water_absorbent','flexible','porous','opaque','electrically_insulating'],
   art:'/art/items/welding_gloves/art.txt',
   armor:{layer:'normal',regions:[{region:'left_hand',encumbrance:7},{region:'right_hand',encumbrance:7},{region:'left_arm',coverage:2500,encumbrance:2},{region:'right_arm',coverage:2500,encumbrance:2}],protection:{blunt:200,slashing:350,piercing:150}}},
  {type:'item', id:'tool_belt', name:'tool belt', mass_g:600, volume_ml:1000,
   description:'A leather belt with deep pouches, rubbed pale along their mouths. It suggests a place for the few things you still expect to need tomorrow.',
   flags:['clothing','container','combustible','water_absorbent','flexible','porous','opaque'],
   art:'/art/items/tool_belt/art.txt', capabilities:[{type:'container',id:'storage',capacity_volume_ml:4000}],
   armor:{layer:'strapped',regions:[{region:'torso',coverage:1000,encumbrance:3}],protection:{blunt:60,slashing:100,piercing:30}}},
  {type:'item', id:'canvas_duffel', name:'canvas duffel', mass_g:800, volume_ml:1800,
   description:'An empty canvas bag with a broad shoulder strap and a faded address panel. There is room for another departure, if you can decide what deserves to come along.',
   flags:['clothing','container','combustible','water_absorbent','flexible','collapsible','porous','opaque'],
   art:'/art/items/canvas_duffel/art.txt', capabilities:[{type:'container',id:'storage',capacity_volume_ml:24000}],
   armor:{layer:'strapped',regions:[{region:'torso',coverage:2000,encumbrance:10},{region:'left_arm',coverage:500,encumbrance:3},{region:'right_arm',coverage:500,encumbrance:3}],protection:{blunt:60,slashing:100}}},
  {type:'item', id:'padded_jacket', name:'padded jacket', mass_g:2200, volume_ml:6500,
   description:'Dense layers of cloth and salvaged padding are held together by close, uneven quilting. Someone spent long hours making a jacket for the moment when a locked door would no longer be enough.',
   flags:['clothing','armor','combustible','water_absorbent','flexible','porous','opaque','electrically_insulating'],
   art:'/art/items/padded_jacket/art.txt',
   armor:{layer:'outer',regions:[{region:'torso',coverage:9500,encumbrance:10},{region:'left_arm',coverage:9500,encumbrance:8},{region:'right_arm',coverage:9500,encumbrance:8}],protection:{blunt:500,slashing:650,piercing:300},wear_cost:180,remove_cost:150}},
  {type:'item', id:'wooden_club', name:'wooden club', mass_g:1000, volume_ml:1600,
   description:'The square timber has been pared down to a grip, leaving its weight at the far end. Fresh tool marks make it look less like something found than a decision finally made.',
   flags:['melee_weapon','combustible','water_absorbent','porous','rigid','opaque','electrically_insulating'],
   art:'/art/items/wooden_club/art.txt',
   melee:{damage:[{type:'blunt',amount:1100}],attack_cost:115,handling_skill:'clubs_hammers',grips:[{kind:'one_handed'}],block_capacity:350,allowed_responses:['parry','block']}},
  {type:'item', id:'quarterstaff', name:'quarterstaff', mass_g:1400, volume_ml:3000,
   description:'A long timber shaft shaved smooth where both hands settle. Its plain grain has the quiet reassurance of work finished carefully, with nothing concealed beneath the surface.',
   flags:['melee_weapon','combustible','water_absorbent','porous','rigid','opaque','electrically_insulating'],
   art:'/art/items/quarterstaff/art.txt',
    melee:{damage:[{type:'blunt',amount:1100}],attack_cost:105,handling_skill:'polearms',grips:[{kind:'two_handed',rating_bonus100:50}],block_capacity:950,allowed_responses:['parry','block']}},
  {type:'item', id:'salvaged_machete', name:'salvaged machete', mass_g:1000, volume_ml:1300,
   description:'A broad scrap-steel blade sits above a wire-bound wooden grip. The file marks have not quite disappeared; whoever shaped it stopped when it could do the work, not when it looked new.',
   flags:['melee_weapon','tool','sharp_edge','electrically_conductive','ferromagnetic','combustible','water_absorbent','porous','rigid','opaque','thermally_conductive'],
   art:'/art/items/salvaged_machete/art.txt', tool_traits:[{id:'house_cutting',tier:1}],
    melee:{damage:[{type:'slashing',amount:1500}],attack_cost:115,handling_skill:'swords',grips:[{kind:'one_handed'}],block_capacity:300,allowed_responses:['parry','block']}},
  {type:'item', id:'steel_spear', name:'steel spear', mass_g:2000, volume_ml:3500,
   description:'A worked steel point is pinned into a pipe shaft, with a fitted wooden grip beneath the binding. Patient filing and careful joints have turned building stock into an unmistakable weapon.',
   flags:['melee_weapon','pointed','sharp_edge','electrically_conductive','ferromagnetic','combustible','water_absorbent','porous','rigid','opaque','thermally_conductive'],
   art:'/art/items/steel_spear/art.txt',
   melee:{damage:[{type:'piercing',amount:1700,penetration:150}],attack_cost:145,handling_skill:'polearms',grips:[{kind:'two_handed'}],block_capacity:650,allowed_responses:['parry','block']}},
]}
